FIRST INFORMATION REPORT
(Under Section 173 BNSS)
1. District: Ghaziabad    P.S.: Indirapuram    Year: 2026    FIR No: 0142/2026
Date of FIR: 12/08/2026    Time: 18:20 hrs
2. Acts & Sections: BNS Section 303(2), 3(5)
3. Occurrence: Date 11/08/2026, Time from 21:00 to 23:30 hrs
5. Place of Occurrence: Shipra Mall Road, Indirapuram, Ghaziabad
6. Complainant / Informant:
- Name: Rahul Sharma
- Father's Name: Alok Sharma
- Address: Flat 402, Skyline Apartments, Indirapuram
- Mobile: +91 98765 43210
7. Details of Known / Suspected / Unknown Accused:
- Sunil Verma, resident of Khora Colony, seen fleeing on motorcycle UP14 AB 4521.
8. Details of Properties Stolen:
- 1x Dell laptop worth Rs. 65,000/-
- Cash Rs 12,500
9. Brief Facts: The complainant states that on 11 August 2026 his laptop bag was stolen from his parked car. Witness Meena Devi saw the accused fleeing. The accused had called the complainant on 9811122233 demanding Rs. 2 lakh.
10. Investigating Officer: SI Amit Kumar
